<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Reset your password</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            color: #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            color: #4f5ef1;
        }

        .content {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            background-color: #4f5ef1;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .link {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #4f5ef1;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Reset your password</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
            <p>We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to choose a new one. This link
                expires in <%= expireMinutes %> minutes.</p>
            <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
            <p class="link">Or copy this link into your browser:<br />
                <%= resetUrl %>
            </p>
            <p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to <a href="mailto:contact.japnadnewstimes@gmail.com">contact our
                    support team</a>.</p>
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> The Journalism. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>